  <p class="muted" style="font-size:14px;">
    All URLs stable for the canonical release. For research that must reference an exact snapshot,
    cite the Zenodo DOI corresponding to the weekly release version (reported in the footer of every
    page). Column schemas follow semantic versioning; breaking changes trigger a major-version bump
    with a one-release deprecation window.
  </p>

